        /// | **`write_mask(val)`** | Sets only the bits that are high (1) in `val`.  |
        /// | **`mask()`**          | Returns the bitmask for this field.             |
        /// | **`max()`**           | Returns the maximum value this field can hold.  |
        /// | **`in_range(val)`**   | Returns true if val fits in the field.          |
